[
  {
    "op": "add",
    "path": "/fields/System.Title",
    "value": "Display New Employee Form"
  },
  {
    "op": "add",
    "path": "/fields/System.Description",
    "value": "<p>As a HR user, I want to open the New Employee Form by clicking the New button, so that I can enter details for a new employee.</p><p><strong>Acceptance Criteria:</strong></p><ul><li>The New button is visible on the Employee List page.</li><li>Clicking New opens the New Employee Form.</li><li>The form contains fields for employee information.</li><li>The user can cancel and return to the Employee List.</li></ul>"
  }
]

[
  {
    "op": "add",
    "path": "/fields/System.Title",
    "value": "Enter Employee Personal Information"
  },
  {
    "op": "add",
    "path": "/fields/System.Description",
    "value": "<p>As a HR user, I want to enter an employee's personal information, so that the employee record contains the required personal details.</p><p><strong>Acceptance Criteria:</strong></p><ul><li>The form allows entry of first name and last name.</li><li>The form allows entry of date of birth.</li><li>The form allows entry of gender.</li><li>Required fields must be completed before saving.</li></ul>"
  }
]

[
  {
    "op": "add",
    "path": "/fields/System.Title",
    "value": "Enter Employee Contact Information"
  },
  {
    "op": "add",
    "path": "/fields/System.Description",
    "value": "<p>As a HR user, I want to enter the employee's contact information, so that the organization can contact the employee.</p><p><strong>Acceptance Criteria:</strong></p><ul><li>The user can enter an email address.</li><li>The user can enter a phone number.</li><li>The user can enter a residential address.</li><li>Email format must be validated.</li></ul>"
  }
]

[
  {
    "op": "add",
    "path": "/fields/System.Title",
    "value": "Validate Employee Information"
  },
  {
    "op": "add",
    "path": "/fields/System.Description",
    "value": "<p>As a HR user, I want the system to validate employee information before saving, so that invalid employee records are not created.</p><p><strong>Acceptance Criteria:</strong></p><ul><li>Required fields are validated.</li><li>Email addresses are validated.</li><li>Invalid dates are rejected.</li><li>Validation errors are displayed next to the relevant fields.</li><li>The employee cannot be saved while validation errors exist.</li></ul>"
  }
]

[
  {
    "op": "add",
    "path": "/fields/System.Title",
    "value": "Save New Employee"
  },
  {
    "op": "add",
    "path": "/fields/System.Description",
    "value": "<p>As a HR user, I want to save a completed employee form, so that a new employee record is created in the system.</p><p><strong>Acceptance Criteria:</strong></p><ul><li>The employee information is validated before saving.</li><li>A unique employee ID is generated.</li><li>The employee record is persisted.</li><li>A successful save message is displayed.</li><li>The user is returned to the Employee List.</li></ul>"
  }
]

[
  {
    "op": "add",
    "path": "/fields/System.Title",
    "value": "Generate Employee Number"
  },
  {
    "op": "add",
    "path": "/fields/System.Description",
    "value": "<p>As a HR user, I want the system to automatically generate a unique employee number, so that every employee can be uniquely identified.</p><p><strong>Acceptance Criteria:</strong></p><ul><li>The employee number is generated when the employee is saved.</li><li>Employee numbers must be unique.</li><li>The user cannot manually enter an employee number.</li><li>The generated number is displayed after saving.</li></ul>"
  }
]

[
  {
    "op": "add",
    "path": "/fields/System.Title",
    "value": "Edit Employee"
  },
  {
    "op": "add",
    "path": "/fields/System.Description",
    "value": "<p>As a HR user, I want to edit an existing employee record, so that employee information can be kept up to date.</p><p><strong>Acceptance Criteria:</strong></p><ul><li>The user can select an employee from the Employee List.</li><li>Existing employee information is displayed.</li><li>The user can modify editable fields.</li><li>Changes are validated before saving.</li><li>Updated information is persisted.</li></ul>"
  }
]

[
  {
    "op": "add",
    "path": "/fields/System.Title",
    "value": "Search Employees"
  },
  {
    "op": "add",
    "path": "/fields/System.Description",
    "value": "<p>As a HR user, I want to search for employees by employee number or name, so that I can quickly find an employee record.</p><p><strong>Acceptance Criteria:</strong></p><ul><li>The user can search by employee number.</li><li>The user can search by first name.</li><li>The user can search by last name.</li><li>Search results display matching employees.</li><li>The search supports partial names.</li></ul>"
  }
]

[
  {
    "op": "add",
    "path": "/fields/System.Title",
    "value": "View Employee Details"
  },
  {
    "op": "add",
    "path": "/fields/System.Description",
    "value": "<p>As a HR user, I want to view an employee's details, so that I can review the information stored for that employee.</p><p><strong>Acceptance Criteria:</strong></p><ul><li>The user can select an employee from search results.</li><li>Employee personal information is displayed.</li><li>Employee contact information is displayed.</li><li>Employee employment information is displayed.</li><li>The information is read-only unless the user chooses Edit.</li></ul>"
  }
]

[
  {
    "op": "add",
    "path": "/fields/System.Title",
    "value": "Deactivate Employee"
  },
  {
    "op": "add",
    "path": "/fields/System.Description",
    "value": "<p>As a HR administrator, I want to deactivate an employee, so that employees who are no longer active cannot be treated as current employees.</p><p><strong>Acceptance Criteria:</strong></p><ul><li>An administrator can deactivate an employee.</li><li>The system asks for confirmation.</li><li>Deactivated employees cannot be selected as active employees.</li><li>The employee record remains available for historical purposes.</li></ul>"
  }
]

[
  {
    "op": "add",
    "path": "/fields/System.Title",
    "value": "Prevent Duplicate Employee"
  },
  {
    "op": "add",
    "path": "/fields/System.Description",
    "value": "<p>As a HR user, I want the system to detect potential duplicate employees, so that duplicate employee records are not created.</p><p><strong>Acceptance Criteria:</strong></p><ul><li>The system checks existing employees before saving.</li><li>Matching employee numbers cannot be duplicated.</li><li>Potential duplicate names and dates of birth are flagged.</li><li>The user receives an appropriate warning.</li></ul>"
  }
]

[
  {
    "op": "add",
    "path": "/fields/System.Title",
    "value": "Assign Employee Department"
  },
  {
    "op": "add",
    "path": "/fields/System.Description",
    "value": "<p>As a HR user, I want to assign an employee to a department, so that the employee is associated with the correct organizational unit.</p><p><strong>Acceptance Criteria:</strong></p><ul><li>The department can be selected from a list.</li><li>Only active departments can be selected.</li><li>The selected department is stored with the employee.</li><li>The department is displayed on the employee details page.</li></ul>"
  }
]

[
  {
    "op": "add",
    "path": "/fields/System.Title",
    "value": "Assign Employee Manager"
  },
  {
    "op": "add",
    "path": "/fields/System.Description",
    "value": "<p>As a HR user, I want to assign a manager to an employee, so that the reporting relationship is recorded.</p><p><strong>Acceptance Criteria:</strong></p><ul><li>The user can select an active employee as manager.</li><li>An employee cannot be assigned as their own manager.</li><li>The manager relationship is persisted.</li><li>The manager is displayed on the employee details page.</li></ul>"
  }
]

[
  {
    "op": "add",
    "path": "/fields/System.Title",
    "value": "View Employee Audit History"
  },
  {
    "op": "add",
    "path": "/fields/System.Description",
    "value": "<p>As a HR administrator, I want to view changes made to an employee record, so that I can understand how employee information has changed over time.</p><p><strong>Acceptance Criteria:</strong></p><ul><li>Changes to employee information are recorded.</li><li>The history contains the date and time of the change.</li><li>The history identifies the user who made the change.</li><li>Previous and new values are available for relevant fields.</li></ul>"
  }
]

[
  {
    "op": "add",
    "path": "/fields/System.Title",
    "value": "Export Employee List"
  },
  {
    "op": "add",
    "path": "/fields/System.Description",
    "value": "<p>As a HR user, I want to export the employee list, so that I can use employee information for reporting and analysis.</p><p><strong>Acceptance Criteria:</strong></p><ul><li>The user can export the current employee list.</li><li>The export contains employee number and name.</li><li>The export contains department and employment status.</li><li>The exported file can be opened in a spreadsheet application.</li></ul>"
  }
]
